      },
      "display": {
        "lines": "79",
        "section": "SRS §3"
      },
      "text": "- **W-CS8-N (nominal):** findings for cycle N in → writes `proposals/prop-004.diff` + `proposals/prop-004.dispositions.md` (every finding id present with a draft disposition); property: **`spec.md` hash unchanged** across the entire agent turn."
    },
    {
      "fragmentId": "sf:e2b36360feaa62fe926f6edc",
      "label": "C-S8.W-CS8-D1",
