      "display": {
        "lines": "81",
        "section": "SRS §3"
      },
      "text": "- Determinism note: proposal content varies; properties — diff applies cleanly to the cited rev; disposition draft covers every open finding id; the two hash properties above."
    },
    {
      "fragmentId": "sf:04eac17e8bc83dc926ac8b4d",
      "label": "J-S2.chain",
      "kind": "text-span",
      "source": {
        "doc": "SPEC.md",
        "digest": "sha256:2428b115bafe685044b88f97ac11f6ba28e1179c45989ee1b596b72ae3c89450"
