      "normalizationVersion": "norm-spike-1",
      "textHash": "sha256:58f1c2771ecf8e6687f1737557d4b763d5abf1c19db132e465707df45981fa61",
      "anchors": {
        "before": "sha256:e91cc4ed0bcba568a34761fed8873bf7c9c277032900d9727004cfb13623a2fd",
        "after": "sha256:5682ce2805460e8913ac2ae6b3a5656727b0d1c035cd7cb307c99421baac28c7"
      },
      "display": {
        "lines": "26",
        "section": "SRS §2"
      },
      "text": "**J-S2 — refine (one turn of the loop).** Chain example **W-JS2**: (1) C-S4 panel emits findings into `findings/cycle-N/` for spec rev **`<SHA₀>`**; (2) C-S8 drafts `proposals/prop-K.diff` + draft dispositions — `spec.md` hash unchanged; (3) operator merges (Part II J-O2) → rev **`<SHA₁>`**; (4) C-S6 computes the walk for diff(**`<SHA₀>`**, **`<SHA₁>`**) from `derived/citations.json`; (5) walk discharged item-by-item; (6) C-S1, C-S2×2, C-S3 re-run at **`<SHA₁>`**. Outcome: a new adjudicated report whose findings register shows every cycle-N finding dispositioned, none deleted."
    },
    {
