      "display": {
        "lines": "85",
        "section": "SRS §4"
      },
      "text": "Records: `Spec {path, rev}` (state) · `GradeRecord` (event, per W-CS2-N) · `Finding` (event, append-only) · `Disposition {finding_id, kind ∈ resolved | otherwise | deferred | rejected, reasons}` (event) · `WalkItem {citer, cites, status}` (state, derived) · `LedgerEntry` (event, hash-chained) · `ClosureRow {clause, class, falsifier, validation, gate}` (derived, C-S1 only)."
    },
