      },
      "text": "- **W-CS4-N (nominal):** closure-auditor perspective on a fixture with an unwitnessed rule → appends `findings/cycle-1/closure-auditor-001.json` = `{\"id\": \"F-<n>\", \"source\": \"closure-auditor\", \"severity\": \"major\", \"clause\": \"spec.md:§4/R-2\", \"text\": \"R-2 names no witness; pairing is unidirectional\"}`; property: **all pre-existing files under `findings/` byte-identical** — append-only, the absence of modification is the assertion."
